    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d610">

                <pb facs="0750" n="740" sameAs="frus:frus1948v07/pg740"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.796/8–3048: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Consul at Tihwa</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Paxton</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Tihwa</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1948-08-30T17:00:00+06:00">August 30, 1948—5
                            p. m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received August 31—6:26 a. m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>82. Today Liu called prior to departure for 2 weeks’ conference and yielded
                    following information reference Deptel 32, August 27:<anchor n="27"
                        xml:id="d610-f1"/>
                </p>
                <p>(1) Only after our talk reported mytel to Embassy 159, August26<anchor n="28"
                        xml:id="d610-f2"/> had he received news from Foreign Office (perhaps from Pu
                    Tao-ming en route Paris) that termination notice had already been given to
                    Soviet authorities and (2) he still, however, has authority to negotiate new
                    agreement if Chinese demands for more favorable treatment are met. He said that
                    his own staff had not been told of this and asked that it be kept confidential,
                    particularly from Chinese officials.</p>
                <p>This message sent through Department since Tihwa has very small reserve of OT
                    Pads with Embassy (see mytel 71, July 18,<anchor n="29" xml:id="d610-f3"/> as
                    yet unanswered), and it seems better to save remainder for emergency.</p>
                <p>Sent Department 82, repeated Nanking 162.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Paxton</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
